  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A mechanical device in a workshop produces items at a constant rate of <math alttext=\"60\"><mn>60</mn>\n</math> items per hour. At this rate, how many items will the mechanical device produce in <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math> hours?</p>",
